  "notes": "No bot check or captcha was met on the operator's site. Logo is the full-size original of the landscape logo used in the site header (the page serves a 2560 pixel scaled copy, ASC-Logo-Landscape-Simplified-scaled.png, as well). No heroImage is set here: the facts file already uses the Augusta page's own top photo (1200 by 600, a Whale Song and mother-and-calf aerial), which is the best wide shot found; the Busselton page's square spray-breach photo (whale-breeches-with-spray-of-water.jpg, 1440 by 1439) is in the gallery as the alternative. The same eight-photo whale carousel (files named whale-watching-augusta-...) is shown on the Augusta, Busselton and Dunsborough pages, so the three whale trips share those photos; a person should check that none shows the wrong location. Videos: the first five are from the YouTube channel the site footer links to (youtube.com/channel/UCY1tgshkbXu6WzDzgSKytkg), read through its public feed; the sixth is a hosted .mp4 that loops on the snorkelling page, its subject was not checked and is titled from the page. Channel videos left out: a breaching humpback clip whose description credits another photographer, a clip showing the Tradewind III boat, and shorter or untitled clips. The snorkel trip has only two candidate photos: the home page's 'Family Snorkelling' photo (6605-copy-1.jpg, origin not stated) and the site's cropped card thumbnail for Carnac Island Snorkelling (an Elementor thumbnail, probably low resolution); another card thumbnail (IMG_1195) was left out because its subject is unlabelled. Left out on purpose: the home page backgrounds and slider (files named shutterstock_, a Getty-style 'gty' file, and unnamed or numeric files of unknown source), the Tripadvisor Travellers' Choice badge graphics (text printed on the image: TripAdvisor-Winner-All-Sea-Charters-Whale-Watching-Tours.jpg, travellers-choice-2023.gif, trip-advisor-awards.png, TC-Winner-2021.gif), accreditation and partner logos (Tourism WA, Margaret River Region, QTAB, terc, marine, tick), the two Margaret River region photos captioned 'Image Source: margaretriver.com' (Busselton-Jetty-Margaret-River-Region-All-Sea-Charters.jpg and All-Sea-Charters-Exploring-Dunsborough.jpg), a photo named for a photographer (beach-yallingup-beach-family-friendly-jennifer-morton), the Dolphin Discovery Centre photos on the swim-with-dolphins page (that business's tours), Facebook-numbered card thumbnails (70516679_..., 37836499_..., 43240590_..., 70934436_..., 40553420_...) whose photographer is not stated, other hash-named card images (augusta-59a7bf..., 071e8bc2...), the Tripadvisor reviewer avatars, and staff portraits (crew page) which are not general photos. The tender photo (All-Sea-Charters-Whale-Tail.jpg) is on the boats page and is in the gallery, not under a trip. Not downloaded or measured; the importer should check sizes."
